       accruals included) on every coupon date from year one; no credit risk. The same bond is
       also booked as a plain Bond trade: its NPV is the straight-bond reference every callable
       engine's strippedBondNpv must reproduce. -->
  <Trade id="CALLABLE_BOND">
    <TradeType>CallableBond</TradeType>
    <Envelope>
      <CounterParty>CPTY</CounterParty>
      <NettingSetId>NS</NettingSetId>
    </Envelope>
    <CallableBondData>
